<p>Someone asked to set a new password for the parish website editor.</p>

<p><a href="<%= @url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:.6rem 1.1rem;background:#8B1A1A;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px">Choose a new password</a></p>

<p style="color:#555;font-size:.9rem">It stops working in two hours, and as soon as it has been used once.</p>

<p style="color:#555;font-size:.9rem">If this was not you, nothing has happened and you can ignore this message — your password has not changed. But do tell us, because it means somebody knows your address and is trying.</p>

<p style="color:#555;font-size:.9rem">If the button does not work, copy this in:<br>
<span style="word-break:break-all"><%= @url %></span></p>
